PASS: P1g3: evidence head differing from the record's review_head is inadmissible
PASS: P1g4: evidence base differing from the record's review_base is inadmissible
PASS: m1: record refuses (rc 2) a verdict file with no 'round'
PASS: m1b: archived evidence with no 'round' is inadmissible at gate time
