PASS: P3n (negative control): every batch listing cY has a qualifying latest GO -> COVERED
PASS: P3d: cZ dropped from batch BA after BA's NO-GO on it is still blocked by BA
PASS: P3e (negative control): cZ dropped from BA after a qualifying GO on it does not block BB's coverage
PASS: P3f: a change dropped from its only batch's latest round is UNCOVERED (the latest round no longer covers it)
PASS: P3g: a backfilled historical NO-GO on cQ blocks a live GO in another batch
PASS: P3h (negative control): a backfilled historical zero-finding GO does not block a live GO elsewhere
